      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "256"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46784f210116e03504628629",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "大家都很专注啊\n有望看到一场精彩的比赛了",
      "source_fingerprint": "18c88764202d8f227403c2ddae6a56d42c9ed223597833fad4d2254568906bdd",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "26"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5288ce066a2532f3a7c34e1",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "让我们期待起跑失利马娘的反击吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc5ec5514d366b20774c48c8e13d1619b34bec6d2f8801389a3caebdb3d15032",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "28"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4b0f71b4669f1e1d30cca8a",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "应该也有和这种程度的马场\n更加合得来的赛马娘在",
      "source_fingerprint": "df7c2d6e72e563ed89dd47405c8dee3e1fcc81fb4046d4cc82fc66a15c001297",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78ee0d4ffa88ddf2ee88d98f",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "面向这场比赛的状态极佳呢\n能看出她身心状态调整得非常到位",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6885d58a42b29e952ba62c8b9d20de3d4c0612e6fbc373e0f0d95ea97e7e4b5",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5ade1dd62caaf08aa06579b",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "她的下肢很稳健\n感觉状态不错",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ffc75189bc6b1e6d6b58bf2f738b63bd36e84a7b02feffbd5a87f6f5200becd",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b24b3fce216aab7e231b6e4b",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "虽然人气有所下降\n但她柔软灵活的身体给人留下了好印象呢",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3f814f9e39cd091b71c8320ba8b390a959b47e551e7551a41463f12fbdb30bb",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3fc0cafe100d7ae9bf2c125b",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "每位马娘我都见过所以有些犹豫呢\n但非要选一个出来那就是这位了",
      "source_fingerprint": "f592393a04e755534a2d166765268c81ae3a7ff6b7faca5eede8e47e370db861",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0d94a451568bbc51cc17247",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "虽然人气不高，但感觉她很有潜力呢\n是我最推荐的赛马娘",
      "source_fingerprint": "03e924b35474c847ab82deecce8fd0b72de0c51e07bf8ba53d1912d5a9585585",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa8b61e21c0b80bbc13fef9c",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "能如同流星一般划过跑道\n希望她能证明自己那种一流的速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d26683c00cd463c11f3d6e0dbef376b668721acd505b2a62397a7b31bb9c57c",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32a343c0767cf7dc3c83837f",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "兼具优秀的速度与力量\n英里路线的最强者肯定就是这位赛马娘了",
      "source_fingerprint": "2931420b7c4abae60cb23fef426ab89a9d3c05f005f118618924de4c4e54ecd7",
